..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : CASHMGMT.SELECT.INIT.BATCH
.. Autor          : male
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : mh
.. Funktion       : Initialisierung der Selektion
.. Functionality  :
.. include fb/CASHMGMT.INIT.PERIODS
.. include fb/CASHMGMT.INIT.TAX.PERIODS
..*****************************************************************************
..
.set trans -
..
.copy U|xdstartdate  = G|datum
.formula   U|xiperiodtype = "(Week)"
.formula   U|ximaxperiod  = 13
.formula   U|xitufactor   = 1
..
.input "fb/CASHMGMT.INIT.PERIODS"
.input "fb/CASHMGMT.INIT.TAX.PERIODS"
.file -tempname U|xtout
.continue END
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
..*****************************************************************************
.continue

